#### [NEW] `src/lib/supabase/client.ts`
Browser-side Supabase client using `createBrowserClient` from `@supabase/ssr`.

#### [NEW] `src/lib/supabase/server.ts`
Server-side Supabase client using `createServerClient` with cookie handling for Next.js App Router (Server Components, Route Handlers, Server Actions).

#### [NEW] `src/lib/supabase/middleware.ts`
Helper to create Supabase client inside Next.js middleware for automatic JWT refresh.

#### [NEW] `src/middleware.ts`
Root middleware — refreshes Supabase auth tokens on every request and protects `/admin/*` routes (redirect to `/admin/login` if unauthenticated).

#### [NEW] `src/lib/database.types.ts`
Auto-generated TypeScript types from Supabase schema (generated via `supabase gen types typescript`).

