### Phase 2 — Database Migrations

All SQL files go into `supabase/migrations/` for version control.

#### [NEW] `supabase/migrations/001_schema.sql`
Creates all 8 tables: `admin_users`, `projects`, `skills`, `certifications`, `achievements`, `content_pages`, `page_analytics`, `audit_log` — with all constraints and indexes per the SOW.

#### [NEW] `supabase/migrations/002_rls_policies.sql`
Enables RLS on every table and creates all policies (public read for published content, admin-only write, etc.) per Section 2.4 of the SOW.

#### [NEW] `supabase/migrations/003_functions_triggers.sql`
- `update_updated_at_column()` trigger function + triggers on 5 tables
- `log_audit_event()` trigger function + triggers on 4 core tables

#### [NEW] `supabase/migrations/004_seed_data.sql`
Seed data for testing: sample projects, skills, certifications, achievements, and content pages. Admin user created via Supabase Auth, then linked in `admin_users`.

